/-!
# Explicit prefixes of the eleven matrix words

Each prefix is stored as a base-four or base-three integer encoding its
sixteen matrix entries. The untrusted `source/generate.py` computes them.
`Relations` verifies every adjacent multiplication and endpoint, keeping
kernel reduction bounded independently of word length.
-/

